msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Нет, я—!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_191FB2B0_6141_4458_A371_C8183519C3C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c239229c9a3f4204abefb067cbd51b6771f22c00190c08ad404651911f951237
