msgid "⟪k:0⟫He rarely ever listens to me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Он вообще редко меня слушает..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E1D3A8AE_F232_41DB_ADC7_875E597E9070
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 794d5a6a846700a9ccdb58bbb57b908457310acb8cef6fe3d5a93e1467265c15
