#: scenario3:scenario3_ED66B8D9_83CC_4613_99DE_1C26A61D6556
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0fb3ff319093be68ceb715e54b2232fec975d00a6e981a1c37d8c09f0c71bb2
